%% =============================================================================
flowchart TD
    Y1([Driver Launches transport_mobile_app]) --> Y2[Auto-Register Device Push Token: POST /api/notifications/device-token]
    Y2 --> Y3{Driver Action}
    
    Y3 -- Daily Timecard --> Y4[Tab attendance.tsx: Tap 'Clock In' -> POST /api/requests/attendance]
    
    Y3 -- Trip Manifest --> Y5[Tab trips.tsx: View Assigned Manifest]
