    Y6 --> Y7[Tap 'Open GPS Navigation' -> Launch External Google Maps Navigation]
    Y7 --> Y8[At Destination: Complete e-POD Sign-Off / Submit Gate Photo]
    
    Y3 -- Road Expense --> Y9[Log Fuel / Toll: Input Liters, Odometer, Snap Receipt]
    Y9 --> Y10[POST /api/expenses/log]

    Y3 -- SOS Emergency --> Y11[Tap Floating Red SOS Panic Button]
    Y11 --> Y12[POST /api/incidents/report -> Trigger Dispatcher Siren Alarm]

    Y3 -- Payslip History --> Y13[Tab paycheck.tsx: View Monthly Net Pay & TRAIN Tax Deductions]
    Y3 -- Time-Off Filing --> Y14[Tab requests.tsx: Submit Leave Request with Date Range]

